if {Day2_response} == "Yes":
	[voice path="res://Assets/Audio/VA/Smith/Bad-Attack.mp3" volume="0.0" bus="Character Voice"]
	Smith: Suth, do you read me? Real bad attack happened down south last night. Don't know how they slipped past us. Bloody animals. Be safe over there. By the way, we're expecting a Swedish cargo ship tonight. Thanks for your help. Over.
elif {Day2_response} == "No":
	[voice path="res://Assets/Audio/VA/Misc Radio/Radio American.mp3" volume="0.0" bus="Character Voice"]
	"Suspicious voice": Fair Isle Light, Fair Isle Light, this is American Merchant Vessel SS Liberty Bay, Whiskey Lima Five Six. Do you receive, over?
[voice path="res://Assets/Audio/VA/Sutherland/Container Ship.mp3" volume="0.0" bus="Character Voice"]
Sutherland: (speaking to himself) Ah, container ship.
[voice path="res://Assets/Audio/VA/Sutherland/Aye all clear.mp3" volume="0.0" bus="Character Voice"]
[voice path="res://Assets/Audio/VA/Sutherland/Bright as a star.mp3" volume="0.0" bus="Character Voice"]
Sutherland: Aye, all clear. We'll be bright as a star. Over.